mara (removes the ignore when it lands).\nHANDOFF STATE 2026-11-12 06:00 PST: fix committed with sublinear-capitate-gavial as 518f46f166d in .rebar/worktrees/fix-dependabot, not pushed. AC2 needs the next Dependabot uv run after merge (a dependabot.yml change triggers one).","timestamp":1794491845004830706},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"HANDOFF STATE 2026-11-12 PST: CLOSED (class preexisting, completion signature signed). Changes 3377, 3381, 3383 (final a766b371050). 3377's bare-name ignore matched nothing because Dependabot names each extras variant separately; 3381's `pydantic-ai-slim*` matched but the variants have no current version, so semver-major could not classify the bump; 3383 ignores versions >=2. uv run 43322072674 (14:40 PST) made 0 pydantic-ai-slim 2.x attempts, 0 handled errors, conclusion success. Migration tracked in halfalive-smoky-mara. Plan review and close ran through the worktree CLI on the Anthropic API (anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5) while the Bedrock spend cap held.","timestamp":1794524348770070001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1793829329885907001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"06b997dd-54af-4a5c-93ad-2c4f753109ce","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"ad14-c714-4619-4cd2"},{"link_uuid":"2adddc34-83d5-4331-8f40-bba33f726263","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"abf1-0ad9-70e3-448b"},{"link_uuid":"f464b766-191a-4347-b8b9-88a76ccc4dd3","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4c97-0509-6f3d-424f"},{"link_uuid":"5eecefc0-97d3-449f-a680-f7015855d909","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"aa56-198c-d042-42fc"}],"description":"## Observation\nDependabot Updates run 41918750684 tried `uv lock --upgrade-package pydantic-ai-slim==2.64.0` for 3 extras ([openai], [bedrock], [anthropic,duckduckgo,retries]) and each failed with dependency_file_not_resolvable: 'nava-rebar[agents] depends on pydantic-ai-slim[anthropic]>=1.107,<2 and pydantic-ai-slim==2.64.0 ... unsatisfiable'. .github/dependabot.yml ignores semver-major only for mcp, so every weekly uv run retries this major bump and reports it as an error.\n## Testing\n\nChecked: the Dependabot uv run triggered by the dependabot.yml change (`gh run view <id> --log`) shows the pydantic-ai-slim ignore condition in the job, no `uv lock --upgrade-package pydantic-ai-slim==2.*` attempt, and no dependency_file_not_resolvable for pydantic-ai-slim.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Decide between adopting pydantic-ai-slim 2.x and ignoring its semver-major updates in .github/dependabot.yml, with the reason recorded.\n- [x] [non-codebase] The next Dependabot uv run records no dependency_file_not_resolvable error for pydantic-ai-slim.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Dependabot Updates run 43322072674 for navapbc/rebar; principal=gh CLI repo reader; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh run view --log: ignore condition pydantic-ai-slim* >=2 present, 0 pydantic-ai-slim 2.x upgrade attempts, 0 handled errors, conclusion success","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":".github/dependabot.yml","reason":"ignore pydantic-ai-slim semver-major"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","4c97-0509-6f3d-424f"],["relates_to","aa56-198c-d042-42fc"],["relates_to","abf1-0ad9-70e3-448b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"dea940bc-a529-4640-9308-ad173bb496d1","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"06b6-6717-5a60-43a9","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Dependabot proposes pydantic-ai-slim 2.x, which the <2 cap makes unresolvable","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8de47f0a-9a1e-4e70-ad0b-88925018e665","165dfa0a-9893-4f5b-900d-771c2f806580","38d3d698-77ab-4a8b-